WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Mayor Tom Maxwell endorses Jorge Borrego for House District 118

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Good morning. I'm Tom Maxwell.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.900
I'm mayor of Universal City, Texas, and I encourage

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.400
you to get out and vote.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.500
This is our voting season right now, early voting,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.900
and you can vote in any polling place in Bexar County.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.300
This year is a very important election.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.800
It is time to get out because John Lujan is no longer the lead of House District 118.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.600
I mention John Lujan because he is stepping down from House District 118,

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.300
and we need strong leadership to come in and replace him.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.900
John has been really good to Universal City and for Universal City.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.300
He works well with the county agents and county elected officials throughout.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.500
We need someone to replace that man,

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.300
and that man is Jorge Borrego.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.800
Jorge has assured me that he is going to

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.400
continue with the programs for the future growth of Universal City.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.900
And I'm proud to announce that he is also sponsored and supported by John Lujan.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.900
So I do encourage you to get out and vote.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.000
If not today, you've got until October 30th,

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.600
and voting day is on November 3rd.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.600
Like Mayor Tom Maxwell said, early voting is starting now.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.000
Come out, cast your ballot, and let's keep this seat red

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.800
so we could keep the growth here in the northeast part of Bexar County

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.800
and protect our rural communities. Thank you.

